DESCRIPTION >
    Narrow immutable identity-mapping baseline for bulk reporting joins. Activated
    journal changes are overlaid at read time, so recurring identity stays live.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `identifier_key` String `json:$.identifier_key`,
    `profile_id` String `json:$.profile_id`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, identifier_key
ENGINE_SETTINGS "index_granularity=128"

IMPORT_CONNECTION_NAME boom_bigquery_gcs
IMPORT_BUCKET_URI gs://booming-data/tinybird/migration_seed/identity_mapping_serving/snapshot_at=20260826230500/*.parquet
IMPORT_SCHEDULE @on-demand
IMPORT_FORMAT parquet
